.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_exported_port_create_data" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_exported_port_create_data \- Manage Exported Port - Create Data Structure
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_exported_port_create_data {
.br
.BI "    __u8 subnqn[256];"
.br
.BI "    __le16 epid;"
.br
.BI "    __le16 pidud;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 trsvcid[32];"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd292[28];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "subnqn" 12
Exported NVM Subsystem NQN (SUBNQN) to associate the created
Exported Port with
.IP "epid" 12
Exported Port ID (EPID). Used unless GEPID is set in the MOS
field, in which case this field is ignored and the assigned
Exported Port ID is returned in the CQE result instead.
.IP "pidud" 12
Port ID of the Underlying Port (PIDUD)
.IP "trsvcid" 12
Transport Service ID (TRSVCID), ASCII string
.IP "rsvd292" 12
Reserved
